      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Galva%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Shortly after its founding, the town was briefly called Gefle, a nod to a Swedish seaport from which many Bishop Hill settlers sailed.",
